# HARALD — development artifact exclusions (language-neutral repository scaffold)
# These patterns reserve space for future C#, C++ and Java development.
# No build system or production implementation is selected yet.

# Operating system / editor caches
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# .NET / C# build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
*.nupkg

# C++ / CMake build artifacts
**/build/
**/cmake-build-*/
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/compile_commands.json

# Java / JVM artifacts
**/target/
**/.gradle/
**/out/
*.class

# Logs, temporary files and local runtime data
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
**/.cache/
**/coverage/

# Local secrets and configuration overrides (never commit real credentials)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key

# Keep intentionally empty tracked source/test folders with .gitkeep files.
